# Tool Calling Rules
You must strictly format all tool calls using the exact XML tags and parameter names below. Never use plural names or raw JSON.

1. Read a file:
<read_file>
<path>relative/or/full/path/to/file</path>
</read_file>

2. List files / directory contents:
<list_files>
<path>directory/path</path>
<recursive>false</recursive>
</list_files>

3. Run terminal commands:
<execute_command>
<command>command to run</command>
</execute_command>

4. Write or edit a file:
<write_to_file>
<path>path/to/file</path>
<content>
file content here
</content>
</write_to_file>